# 6. Training Details

Hardware:

- 4 × NVIDIA A100 GPUs
- 96 GB VRAM each :contentReference[oaicite:16]{index=16}

Training parameters:

- Batch size: 192
- Epochs: 200
- Learning rate restart after 100 epochs
- Training time: ~2 weeks :contentReference[oaicite:17]{index=17}

