# 11. Implementation Notes for Reproduction

Recommended pipeline:

1. Download MICrONS EM + segmentation layers.
2. Extract synapse-centered volumes.
3. Mask segmentation channels.
4. Implement augmentations.
5. Train 3D-ResNet18 SimCLR model.
6. Extract backbone features.
7. Run downstream tasks.

